From: enjihn <150061999+enjihn@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm: support known-display profiles for EDID-less panels

Expose connector, device_id (GAMESCOPE_INTERNAL_DEVICE_ID, internal
connectors only), internal, and has_edid to known-display matches() so Lua
profiles can identify EDID-less panels.

